class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>指<span class=\"color-value\"></span>向<span class=\"color-value\"></span>同<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>个<span class=\"color-value\"></span>终<span class=\"color-value\"></span>点<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1110106</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kanabijie2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kanabijie2\"><img alt=\"kanabijie2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-kanabijie2.png/600px-Cg-kanabijie2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-kanabijie2.png/900px-Cg-kanabijie2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-kanabijie2.png/1200px-Cg-kanabijie2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">报童：</div><div>重磅新闻！即将改变伦敦的大事件！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有人从他的身后冒了出来，轻轻拍了拍他的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>嘿，汤米！好久不见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">报童：</div><div>星锑！你怎么来了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">报童：</div><div>我们明明前天才碰过面……你最近出现得也太频繁了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">报童：</div><div>你甩开那些像苍蝇一样的探子了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>哼哼～他们现在可没空管我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>昨天，星锑船长遇到了一位怪人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>没错，邋遢小子声称在报纸上给我们留下了遗言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>船长，我想他昨天说的是“惊喜留言”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>噢——没关系，这不重要！汤米，今天的头版新闻是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">报童：</div><div>给你，自己看看吧～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他把一份早已翻皱的报纸塞给了星锑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>“雷米特杯巡展于今日正式开启……足球迷们的狂欢盛会！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>APPLe先生暂时中止了他的翻译器新研究，飘到了星锑的旁边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>“新人类公司宣布接手雷米特杯的展览，他们将启用更多的安保机器人以替代人类工作……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>“如无意外，此次巡展之后，警局将全面引入此套安防系统，伦敦将迎来史无前例的平静局面。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>“……远比人类可靠，一丝不苟的执行者，全方位的城市安全风景线。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>伦敦似乎打算实行更严格的监管，他们计划启用安保机器人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>那些不近人情的铁皮怪物？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>是的，从报纸上的介绍来看，安保机器人们拥有屏蔽信号，影响局部空间磁场的功能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>这恐怕会影响我们广播频道的信号收发功能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>那我们还能“借用”别人的电台频段吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>显然不能……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>星锑捏紧了手里的报纸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>可恶！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>这算是什么惊喜留言！如果机器人占领了伦敦，我的海盗公演计划可就泡汤了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>“新人类公司”……很好，我明白了，邋遢小子是机器人们的同伙，甚至有可能是一个企图控制伦敦的坏蛋头子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>怪不得他看上去和警察们那么不对付，啧啧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">报童：</div><div>喔～听上去是个大新闻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">报童：</div><div>你打算把一手消息提供给报社吗？他们肯定很感兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>算了，毕竟他曾经救过我们……朋友要做的是劝说他放弃这个邪恶的计划。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>星锑船长从不是见利忘义的小人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">报童：</div><div>真遗憾，报社的酬劳相当可观，说不准能给你的爱车配上最新的装备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>你先告诉我，他们给多少？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>船长……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>咳——我，我只是问问！开个玩笑而已！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>星锑把手里那张皱巴巴的报纸塞到了汤米的手里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我现在得去做一件更重要的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>回头见，汤米～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">报童：</div><div>拜！要是改变了主意，随时可以回来找我！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-shezhengjie.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"shezhengjie\"><img alt=\"shezhengjie\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/600px-Cg-shezhengjie.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/900px-Cg-shezhengjie.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/1200px-Cg-shezhengjie.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_zhanlipinxiangce2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_zhanlipinxiangce2\"><img alt=\"at_zhanlipinxiangce2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Cg-at_zhanlipinxiangce2.png/600px-Cg-at_zhanlipinxiangce2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Cg-at_zhanlipinxiangce2.png/900px-Cg-at_zhanlipinxiangce2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Cg-at_zhanlipinxiangce2.png/1200px-Cg-at_zhanlipinxiangce2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>崭新的报纸被挖掘艺术揉成一团，而后又忽地展开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>《快讯！双子星8号宇航员手动完成人类首次太空对接》</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>《第五届长毛绒绒运动会即将开始 有意者请及时携宠物报名》<br />……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他把手上的报纸翻来覆去地看了几遍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>感谢上帝，他终于在两版新闻的夹缝中找到了自己希望看到的内容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>“警方通告，某男子使用特殊手段控制洒水车，恶意破坏交通秩序，获拘留三日处理。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>怎么会这样？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>派对主题、演讲重点、主办人、未来的艺术方向……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>一句都没提及！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>啊……新世界的星辰于昨日升起，却无法让更多人得知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>理想世界的上空弥漫着挥之不去的阴霾，这是伦敦的悲哀，世界的悲哀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我们需要改变！彻底的改变！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>挖掘艺术愤慨地敲击胸口，将手中的报纸高高举起。他来回踱步，如同胸怀大志的诗人一般。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我们不当被娱乐所消解，艺术之锤终将叩响昏聩的警钟——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>伦敦受困于漫长的黑夜，我们需要的绝不只是乏味的星辰，而是更刺眼的太阳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在转了二十七圈半之后，他终于停了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>荒凉的街头根本无法吸引到更多人的目光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>人们早已习惯了盲从，他们只看得见最受注目的东西！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我必须举办一场盛大的，让更多人都无法忽视的，足以推翻主流的艺术派对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>它的地点当然不应该只在街头……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>有了！有了！万众瞩目的雷米特杯展厅，将会是史无前例的、让所有人疯狂的完美舞台！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>挖掘艺术兴奋地离开了，他手上的报纸被洒向空中，仿佛是一份好戏将至的宣告。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪……汪汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪——！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-shezhengjie.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"shezhengjie\"><img alt=\"shezhengjie\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/600px-Cg-shezhengjie.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/900px-Cg-shezhengjie.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/1200px-Cg-shezhengjie.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>训练有素的小狗绝不会放过任何一个接下被抛飞的玩具球的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当然，飘在空中的报纸也算。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TRC-06"}}